  "summary": "Boot failsafe v2 (post adversarial review): PURE client, zero disk writes, zero host logic, passive. Wraps __ModuleLoader__.load at module top level (before EntryTree import phase) so a crashing/malformed client plugin is skipped with a visible banner; strict 404 detection via SCRIPT + /plugins/ + manifest id lookup; localStorage blacklist keyed by {id, rev} (auto-clears when rev changes), self-protection for host loader ids, escape hatch button. No routes, no file writes, no probing. 中文：加载容错 v2（对抗审查修订版）——纯 client 零写入。",
